+**PYJHORA_BEHAVIOR** (`const.pushkara_navamsa`, `charts.planets_in_pushkara_navamsa_bhaga`): per sign start `pn` = [20, 6°40′, 16°40′, 0] by element; zones `[pn, pn+3°20′) ∪ [pn+6°40′, pn+10°)`; nodes included.
+**REFERENCE JSON:** its nine `is_pushkara` flags (Sun, Moon true; others false) all match the DSSME table; PyJHora would also flag **Mercury** (Virgo 14°47′ ∈ 13°20′–16°40′) — 1 of 9 differs.
