+| Sagittarius | 16°40′–20°00′ | 20°00′–23°20′ & 26°40′–30°00′ |
+| Capricorn | 13°20′–16°40′ & 23°20′–26°40′ | 6°40′–10°00′ & 13°20′–16°40′ |
+| Aquarius | 6°40′–10°00′ | 16°40′–20°00′ & 23°20′–26°40′ |
+| Pisces | 10°00′–13°20′ | 0°00′–3°20′ & 6°40′–10°00′ |
