+**DECISION REQUIRED:** (A) DSSME spec table governs (consistent with S-02 / S-01b policy and with the reference JSON); (B) PyJHora's rule; (C) other. Everything else in NAVAMSHA (`d9Placement`, `navamshaPlacements`: D-9 sign, dignity, Vargottama) is built and tested; only `is_pushkara` and block assembly wait.
